text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08164AA9 {
    "{COLOR 0x03}Ahora hay que vencer al\nlìder de Isla NAVEL, DANNY.\pCuando compitas con él recuerda\nla continuidad y la estabilidad\lpara ser efectiv{RIVAL}."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081653D1 {
    "{COLOR 0x03}¡Vamos {PLAYER}! \nJOY está esperando."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08170154 {
    "All my POKéMON does is ROAR...\nNo one dares to come near me...\pSigh... If you would, please take\nthis TM away..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081701C5 {
    "TM05 contains ROAR.\nA ROAR sends POKéMON scurrying."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08170206 {
    "METEOR FALLS\nRUSTBORO CITY THROUGH HERE"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_0817022E {
    "FOSSIL MANIAC’S HOUSE\n“Fossils gratefully accepted!”"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178A9C {
    "Let me see your POKéMON.\nI’ll check to see how much it likes you.\pOh.\nYour POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178AF2 {
    "It adores you.\nIt can’t possibly love you any more.\lI even feel happy seeing it."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178B43 {
    "It seems to be very happy.\nIt obviously likes you a whole lot."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178B82 {
    "It likes you quite a lot.\nIt seems to want to be babied a little."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178BC4 {
    "It’s getting used to you.\nIt seems to believe in you."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178BFA {
    "It’s not very used to you yet.\nIt neither loves nor hates you."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178C39 {
    "It’s very wary.\nIt has scary viciousness in its eyes.\lIt doesn’t like you much at all."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08178C90 {
    "This is a little hard for me to say...\pYour POKéMON simply detests you.\nDoesn’t that make you uncomfortable?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08194917 {
    "¿Sabes?\pEres bueno y es difìcil ver,\naquì y en todos lados,\la alguien con un estilo\ltan impactante como 2.000 vatios.\p¡Es arrojar la POKéBALL\ny haces saltar los fusibles!\pRápido como un rayo\nahora podrás iluminar las cuevas\lcon la potente luz\lque despedirán tus POKéMON.\p¡Ten esta HM DESTELLO!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_08194A3E {
    "Enséñala a quienes elijas\ne iluminarán tu camino.\p¡Y sin necesidad de enchufarlos!\p{COLOR 0x04}¿Ah no?\p¡Menuda tragedia me estás ahorrando!\p{COLOR 0x01}Ja. Ja.\p¡Espero verte pronto {PLAYER}!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A0BE4 {
    "¡Bienvenido!\p¿Puedo ayudarte?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A0C02 {
    "¡Vuelve otra vez !"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A16B6 {
    "It’s soft, loamy soil."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A16CD {
    "It’s soft, loamy soil.\nWant to plant a BERRY?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A16FB {
    "{PLAYER} planted one {STR_VAR_1} BERRY in\nthe soft, loamy soil."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A172C {
    "One {STR_VAR_1} BERRY was planted here."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A174B {
    "{STR_VAR_1} has sprouted."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A175C {
    "This {STR_VAR_1} plant is growing taller."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A177D {
    "These {STR_VAR_1} flowers are blooming\n{STR_VAR_2}."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A179F {
    "very beautifully"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A17B0 {
    "cutely"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A17B7 {
    "prettily"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A17C0 {
    "There are {STR_VAR_2} {STR_VAR_1} BERRIES!\pDo you want to pick the\n{STR_VAR_1} BERRIES?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A17FD {
    "{PLAYER} picked the {STR_VAR_2} {STR_VAR_1} BERRIES."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A181A {
    "{PLAYER} put away the {STR_VAR_1} BERRIES\nin the BAG’s BERRIES POCKET.\pThe soil returned to its soft and\nloamy state."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A1881 {
    "The BAG’s BERRIES POCKET is full.\pThe {STR_VAR_1} BERRIES couldn’t be taken."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A18C5 {
    "{PLAYER} left the {STR_VAR_1} BERRIES\nunpicked."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A18E6 {
    "Want to water the {STR_VAR_1} with the\nWAILMER PAIL?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A1912 {
    "{PLAYER} watered the {STR_VAR_1}."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A1925 {
    "The plant seems to be delighted."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081A1946 {
    "!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081B0E82 {
    "{STR_VAR_1} used {STR_VAR_2}."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081B0F4B {
    "This rock appears to be breakable.\nWould you like to use WHIRPOOL?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081B0F90 {
    "It’s a rugged rock, but a POKéMON\nmay be able to smash it."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC05B {
    "¡Oye!\p¡Hola!\n¡Me llamo Lectro!\py… ¡O te dejo paralizado \nde un chispazo o te regalo algo!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC0B5 {
    "¡Bravo!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC125 {
    "¿Un GOLDUCK? \p¿Crees que eso te fortalece? \p¡Pues empecemos!\n"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC163 {
    "Esto le hace a una pensar.      "
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC289 {
    "I need to exercise after a meal.\nLet’s have a match!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC2BE {
    "Oh, no!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC2C6 {
    "I just had a tasty meal.\nI’m getting drowsy..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC2F5 {
    "Ufufufufufu...\nWant to battle against my POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC327 {
    "M-My POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC337 {
    "A big body that’s all lumpy and hard,\nenormous horns, and vicious fangs...\pUfufufufu...\nI wish I had a POKéMON like that..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC3B3 {
    "Ufufufufufu...\nCome on, battle my POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC3E0 {
    "I feel so lucky getting to see your\nPOKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC40F {
    "Ufufufufufu...\pWhen I see POKéMON battling, I get all\nshivery and shaky..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC45A {
    "If you’re lighting a campfire, make\nsure you have water handy."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC499 {
    "Thanks for dousing my fire!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC4B5 {
    "You really do have to be careful with\nany sort of fire in a forest.\pDon’t ever underestimate the power\nof fire."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC525 {
    "Have you learned to keep water handy\nfor campfires?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC559 {
    "I got hosed down before I could flare\nup, I guess."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC58C {
    "You really do have to be careful with\nany sort of fire in a forest.\pDon’t ever underestimate the power\nof fire."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC5FC {
    "If we were fishing, you wouldn’t stand\na chance against me.\lSo, bring on your POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC653 {
    "If we were fishing, I would’ve won..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC679 {
    "I think I’ll try my luck at landing\na big one at METEOR FALLS.\pThere has to be something in there.\nI just know it."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC6EC {
    "I like to fish. But I also like to\nbattle!\pIf anyone challenges me, I’m there,\neven if I’m fishing."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC750 {
    "I like to battle, but that doesn’t\nmean I’m good at it..."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC78A {
    "This time I’ll do it!\pI always think that, so I can’t walk\naway from fishing or POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC7E3 {
    "TYRA: Well, sure.\nI’m in the mood for it.\lI’ll teach you a little about POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC834 {
    "TYRA: What an amazing battle style!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC88A {
    "TYRA: Giggle...\nIf you want to battle with us, just one\lPOKéMON isn’t enough!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC8D8 {
    "IVY: Who taught you about POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC8FB {
    "IVY: What an amazing battle style!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC91E {
    "IVY: I started training POKéMON\nbecause TYRA, my student mentor,\ltaught me!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081BC96A {
    "IVY: Do you only have one POKéMON?\nI think it must feel lonesome."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081C5803 {
    "I’m gathering BERRIES so I can win a\nPOKéMON CONTEST.\pIf you’d like, I’ll share one with you."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081C5861 {
    "Good luck to you, too!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_081C5878 {
    "What BERRIES should I plant today?\nWhat color オカキクケS should I make?\pFretting over stuff like that is fun\nin its own way."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B67E0 {
    "No subas, este es mi peñón\nY no te dejo subir porque…\p…ehh …\p…tienes demasiados POKéMON.\nVuelve con un equipo menor."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6855 {
    "Soy MARINA\ly este es mi Peñón.\p¡Oye!\n¡Qu tate de las escaleras!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B68A8 {
    "Aquì se hace mi Real voluntad.\p¡No te acerques allì!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B68DD {
    "¡Eh! No te acerques a allì\pporque esa parte…\p…ehh…\pes sólo mía."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B691D {
    " {COLOR 0x01}MARINA:Q quieres ahora?\p{COLOR 0x04}¡Mojarte!\nA ver si se te va la laca maja"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6965 {
    "{COLOR 0x04}Me pareció ver un lindo GOLDUCK…"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6989 {
    "GOLDUCK parece querer unirse al equipo.\p{COLOR 0x04}¡De acuerdo GOLDUCK!\nJuntos derrotaremos a esa harpìa.\pLe bajaremos los humos en una batalla\npara que entienda que no puede ir por\lahì reinando en peñones ni isletas."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6A5B {
    "MARINA: ¡Eh! ¡Tú!\n¿Porqué no me haces caso?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6A87 {
    "{COLOR 0x04}{PLAYER}:¿A quién le importa\nlo que tu digas?\p¡Sube GOLDUCK!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6BB0 {
    "¡Eh!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6BB5 {
    "No te acerques tanto."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6BCB {
    "¿Sabes?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6BDA {
    "Quizás…\pEsta isleta no sea mìa,\nsólo porque intenté quedármela."
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6C1A {
    "MARINA: ¡Gracias!\p{COLOR 0x04}{PLAYER}: ¿Porqué?\p{COLOR 0x01}MARINA: Porque me di cuenta\nque no soy nadie para llegar aquì la\lúltima y decir que me quedo la isleta.\pNo tengo ninguna soberanìa aquì.\pMe iré a mi casa y dejaré de molestar\na toda la gente que podrìa utilizarlo.\pSolo fui una oportunista por aprovechar\nun momento que estaba vacìo\lpara quedarme la isleta.\p¡Adiós {PLAYER}!"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6DC0 {
    "Hummm…\ntu Lapras se ve feliz,\ppero deberìa descansar\ndespués de tan largos viajes.\p¡Buenas! \nSoy la ENFERMERA JOY.\pComo muchas islas son muy pequeñas\npara tener su propio CENTRO POKéMON,\lyo voy donde me necesite la salud\lde un POKéMON, esté donde esté.\p¿Me ayudas?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6EC9 {
    "¡De acuerdo!\pAunque necesitaremos una POCIÓN.\n¿Podrìas conseguirla?"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6F0D {
    "¡Perfecto!\pHay que curar y alimentar\na un SHELLDER enfermo.\p¿No te importa\nque usemos esa POCIÓN no?\p¡Pues ahora mismo marcharemos!\p{COLOR 0x04} ¿A dónde?\p{COLOR 0x01}Dónde están las llaves…"
}

text Naranja_ColdPath_Text_086B6FBA {
    "{COLOR 0x04}¡Ay!\n¡Hoy debe ser San Zambullida!"
}
